WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.239
In under two minutes, you will enter your home in a neighborhood contest.

00:00:04.239 --> 00:00:05.276
We start on the map.

00:00:06.179 --> 00:00:08.072
Tap Places to open the list.

00:00:09.961 --> 00:00:13.294
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:15.139 --> 00:00:17.561
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:17.561 --> 00:00:20.051
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:20.051 --> 00:00:21.397
Tap Use my location.

00:00:23.157 --> 00:00:25.373
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:25.373 --> 00:00:26.025
Tap Allow.

00:00:29.532 --> 00:00:32.027
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:32.027 --> 00:00:33.245
See the three dots?

00:00:33.245 --> 00:00:33.793
Tap them.

00:00:35.394 --> 00:00:37.357
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:39.052 --> 00:00:41.107
Under Live now, tap Enter my home.

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:46.216
If you are not signed in, the site asks you to sign in with Google or your email first.

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:49.703
Add photos of your home.

00:00:49.703 --> 00:00:50.920
Tap Choose photos.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:52.779
The first photo is the cover.

00:00:54.754 --> 00:00:55.706
Tap Next.

00:00:57.657 --> 00:01:00.545
Type your street address and ZIP code.

00:01:00.545 --> 00:01:01.582
Then tap Next.

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:08.510
Choose the name to show, for example, The Kim family.

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:09.428
Then tap Next.

00:01:13.543 --> 00:01:15.962
Tick the box to agree to the rules.

00:01:15.962 --> 00:01:17.641
Then tap Submit my entry.

00:01:20.402 --> 00:01:21.366
You are entered!

00:01:21.366 --> 00:01:24.767
The organizer reviews every entry before it goes on the map.

00:01:25.767 --> 00:01:28.658
Next up: Edit or withdraw your entry.
